{"id":"dym","lemma":"дым","pos":"noun","rank":2439,"glosses":["smoke","hearth, chimney (as a taxable unit for households in medieval Rus and in the Grand Duchy of Lithuania)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/Ru-%D0%B4%D1%8B%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%B4%D1%8B%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"дыма","plural":"дымы"},"examples":[{"text":"Я вижу дым.","en":"I see smoke.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/216708","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},null]},{"text":"Откуда этот дым?","en":"Where's that smoke coming from?","words":[{"g":"whence, from where"},{"g":"this/that one"},null]},{"text":"Я чувствую запах дыма.","en":"I smell smoke.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to feel","l":"чувствовать"},{"g":"smell, odor, scent"},null]},{"text":"Посмотрите на тот дым.","en":"Look at that smoke.","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"that one, those ones"},null]},{"text":"Вы чувствуете запах дыма?","en":"Do you smell smoke?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to feel","l":"чувствовать"},{"g":"smell, odor, scent"},null]}]}